`load_embeddings` attaches each subject's `participants.tsv` columns, as the BIDS loader does, and takes `subject_metadata_df` and `subject_key` (also through `load_data`). A derivative without `participants.tsv` reads it from the dataset it comes from, following `SourceDatasets` from dataset to dataset (embeddings, then preprocessed data, then raw data); it followed one link only, so a dataset two links from the table found none.
